<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8735] Metastorage creates its own index partition</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8735</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;By design, all metastorage data should be stored in single partition with index = 0. However, allocatePageNoReuse is not overriden in MetastorageTree, which causes allocation of extra pages for the tree in index partition.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
